Package: padbridge
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: PadTV Project <padikcz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.41), libgcc-s1, libsdl2-2.0-0, libsdl2-ttf-2.0-0, libsdl2-image-2.0-0, openjdk-21-jre-headless, enjarify, aapt, apksigner, bubblewrap, coreutils, fonts-dejavu-core, python3
Description: Experimental Android API translation for Linux and PadTV
 Signed APK manager, bounded DEX-to-JVM backend, Linux process sandbox and
 limited Android Activity and Wayland widget bridge. No Android OS required.
